{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "调查报告会议  (Praise Instead of Complaints)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Two months into DTS's supervision at Xingtian, Qin Xiao helps convene an internal review meeting where a rival executive invited the two red-carpet commentators to complain about Chun Yuqiao — unaware Kaiwen visited them first. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "各位同事，一转眼我们已经入驻星天两个月了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "今天召开这个会议，是想征集一下大家的意见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我们要完善这两个月以来的调查报告。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "本来这是个内部会议，我们也很荣幸邀请两位老师加入。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "听说两位老师有好的建议要提，请多指教。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "明天我们这个会议，两位老师准备怎么办呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那我还真得好好地感谢您，吕老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "既然孙总盛情邀请了，我看你们就借花献佛吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "毕竟两位老师对淳于总也是非常认可的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "大家都觉得淳于总不光制作能力强，而且专业。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，你打断嘉宾说话，这是干什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，你的话有所指吗？你在会上说这些是不是疯了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "现在我们电视台是行业第一，声誉很重要。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "各位同事，一转眼我们已经入驻星天两个月了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Colleagues, in the blink of an eye we have been stationed at Xingtian for two months.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "今天召开这个会议，是想征集一下大家的意见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We called today's meeting to gather everyone's feedback.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我们要完善这两个月以来的调查报告。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We want to complete our two-month investigation report.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "本来这是个内部会议，我们也很荣幸邀请两位老师加入。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Originally this was an internal meeting, and we are honoured to invite both commentators to join.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "听说两位老师有好的建议要提，请多指教。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We heard both teachers have helpful suggestions to share, so please advise us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "明天我们这个会议，两位老师准备怎么办呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For tomorrow's meeting, what do the two of you plan to do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那我还真得好好地感谢您，吕老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I really must thank you properly, Teacher Lv.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "既然孙总盛情邀请了，我看你们就借花献佛吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since Mr Sun invited you so warmly, why not turn his invitation into goodwill?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "毕竟两位老师对淳于总也是非常认可的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After all, both of you think very highly of Mr Chun Yuqiao as well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "大家都觉得淳于总不光制作能力强，而且专业。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone agrees Mr Chun Yuqiao has strong production skills and professionalism.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，你打断嘉宾说话，这是干什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Sun, interrupting our guests like that — what are you doing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，你的话有所指吗？你在会上说这些是不是疯了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Sun, are you implying something? Have you lost your mind saying this in a meeting?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "现在我们电视台是行业第一，声誉很重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now our network leads the industry, and reputation matters deeply.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "各位同事，一转眼我们已经入驻星天两个月了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "今天召开这个会议，是想征集一下大家的意见。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我们要完善这两个月以来的调查报告。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "本来这是个内部会议，我们也很荣幸邀请两位老师加入。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "听说两位老师有好的建议要提，请多指教。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "明天我们这个会议，两位老师准备怎么办呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那我还真得好好地感谢您，吕老师。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "既然孙总盛情邀请了，我看你们就借花献佛吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "毕竟两位老师对淳于总也是非常认可的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "大家都觉得淳于总不光制作能力强，而且专业。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，你打断嘉宾说话，这是干什么？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，你的话有所指吗？你在会上说这些是不是疯了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "现在我们电视台是行业第一，声誉很重要。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Thanks to Kaiwen's quiet diplomacy, the guests praise Chun Yuqiao instead of complaining, throwing the rival executive's scheme off course. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
